# Requests for VS Code (REST Client) / Visual Studio / Rider.
# 1) Log in on ms-iam and paste the accessToken below.
# 2) Paste the id of one of YOUR places (ms-places) in @placeId.
@devices = http://localhost:3003
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@placeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health (no token): database + mqtt
GET {{devices}}/health

### HU-013 - device of the place (404 device.not_linked if none)
GET {{devices}}/api/places/{{placeId}}/device
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### HU-012 - link (dev device 1 of the seed; it must have sent a heartbeat in the last 10 min)
POST {{devices}}/api/places/{{placeId}}/device
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SW-ESP32-000001",
  "pairingCode": "4HZX-VCDP"
}

### HU-012 - wrong code (400 device.pairing_failed; 5 in a row = 429)
POST {{devices}}/api/places/{{placeId}}/device
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "SW-ESP32-000001",
  "pairingCode": "AAAA-AAAA"
}

### HU-014 - unlink (204)
DELETE {{devices}}/api/places/{{placeId}}/device
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
